    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>A Strange World Hidden Beneath the Abyss</strong> \ud83c\udf0c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since ancient times, a catastrophic event has torn the world apart, leaving behind an endless abyss - where the laws of nature are twisted, where forgotten civilizations lie buried, and where only the bravest dare to descend. The Abyss is not just a land... it is a mystery yet to be unraveled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to step into the depths?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>An adventure unlike anything you've ever experienced</strong> <br>Explore <strong>10 unique worlds</strong> connected by the Abyss - ranging from prehistoric jungles and the kingdom of golems to cursed plains. Each layer holds a puzzle, a challenge, and a story waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Fight, survive, and grow</strong> <br>Face creatures never recorded in history, from wandering phantoms to ancient beasts guarding the Abyss's secrets. Craft, upgrade your gear, build your base... Will you fight head-on, or will you find hidden paths few dare to tread?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Build, tame, and master the Abyss</strong> <br>Use whatever you can find to develop a farm, extract rare resources, and even tame powerful creatures to fight alongside you. But remember, the Abyss is no easy place to survive...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Co-op with friends or brave the journey alone</strong> <br>Your path can be solitary or shared with others. Will you become an explorer, a treasure hunter, or a seeker of truth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26e9\ufe0f <strong>The gate has opened - do you have the courage to step in?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abyss: New Dawn - The journey into the depths has only just begun\u2026</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udccc <strong>Note to Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Translation Notice:</strong><br>Due to limited budget, we weren\u2019t able to hire native translators for all nine supported languages. Instead, we used AI-assisted tools to help ensure accuracy in grammar and context.<br>We sincerely apologize for any awkward phrasing that may remain. If you notice any mistakes or have suggestions for better translations, we\u2019d be truly grateful for your help \u2014 and we\u2019ll patch it as soon as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Quick Heads-up about the Trailer Content:</strong><br>Some of the high-end features shown in the trailer \u2014 such as advanced weapons, outfits, and rare pets \u2014 are real and fully functional.<br>However, they are tied to deeper layers within the 10 core worlds of the game. As of this Early Access version, only the <strong>first two zones</strong> are available:<br>\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Eldergrove</strong> \u2013 the starting realm<br>\u26ab <strong>Primorath</strong> \u2013 the first level of the Abyss</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher-tier resources and crafting materials showcased in the trailer will be introduced in <strong>future updates</strong>, as we continue building out the remaining nine layers.<br>So yes, all the good stuff is coming \u2014 it\u2019ll just take a little adventuring (and patience)!</p>",
