g>Note to Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Translation Notice:</strong><br>Due to limited budget, we weren\u2019t able to hire native translators for all nine supported languages. Instead, we used AI-assisted tools to help ensure accuracy in grammar and context.<br>We sincerely apologize for any awkward phrasing that may remain. If you notice any mistakes or have suggestions for better translations, we\u2019d be truly grateful for your help \u2014 and we\u2019ll patch it as soon as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Quick Heads-up about the Trailer Content:</strong><br>Some of the high-end features shown in the trailer \u2014 such as advanced weapons, outfits, and rare pets \u2014 are real and fully functional.<br>However, they are tied to deeper layers within the 10 core worlds of the game. As of this Early Access version, only the <strong>first two zones</strong> are available:<br>\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Eldergrove</strong> \u2013 the starting realm<br>\u26ab <strong>Primorath</strong> \u2013 the first level of the Abyss</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher-tier resources and crafting materials showcased in the trailer will be introduced in <strong>future updates</strong>, as we continue building out the remaining nine layers.<br>So yes, all the good stuff is coming \u2014 it\u2019ll just take a little adventuring (and patience)!</p>",
